        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:560px\"><h2>You are registered! 🎉</h2><p>Hi {{ $('Generate Participant ID').first().json.fullName }},</p><p>Thank you for registering for <b>{{ $('Config').first().json.eventName }}</b>.</p><ul><li><b>Participant ID:</b> {{ $('Generate Participant ID').first().json.participantId }}</li><li><b>Date:</b> {{ new Date($('Config').first().json.eventDate).toLocaleString('en-GB', { dateStyle: 'full', timeStyle: 'short' }) }}</li><li><b>Venue:</b> {{ $('Config').first().json.eventVenue }}</li></ul><p>Your personal QR pass for check-in will arrive in a separate email in a moment.</p></div>",
